[26.954, "o", "\u001b[1mkickback \u2014 what it does, what it touches, what could break\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[1mWhat it is\u001b[0m\r\r\n  A local companion to the Kickbacks.ai editor extension. It reads the\r\r\n  state that extension already stores on your machine and (optionally)\r\r\n  asks Kickbacks' own backend for your earnings \u2014 then shows it in your\r\r\n  terminal. It is not affiliated with Kickbacks.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mWhat it reads (all local, all yours)\u001b[0m\r\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[2m~/.vibe-ads/cli-ad.json, debug.log\u001b[0m  \u2014 current ad + status the extension wrote\r\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[2m~/.claude/settings.json\u001b[0m  \u2014 to confirm the spinner/statusline are wired\r\r\n  \u2022 your editor's local DB (state.vscdb) \u2014 to read YOUR Kickbacks access token\r\r\n  \u2022 your macOS Keychain \u2014 the key that decrypts that token (same as the editor uses)\r\r\n\r"]
